    },
    {
      "text": "From manufacturing strength to brand strength. Leading an α→ω evolution.",
      "tag": "p",
      "section": "Project Row 2",
      "local": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 710.8
      },
      "box": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 2702.8,
        "w": 736,
        "h": 25.2
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Currently at SSW Sydney, I work at the intersection of human-centred design, product strategy and AI-powered innovation. I take pride in bridging the gap between engineering and design, fostering a shared joy of creation.",
      "tag": "h5",
      "section": "Project Overview",
      "local": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 132
      },
      "box": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 3010,
        "w": 736,
        "h": 92.4
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Previously, I helped Australian startups like Acacia bring ideas from early concept to launch – shaping business decisions while advocating for the user experience.",
      "tag": "h5",
      "section": "Project Overview",
      "local": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 264.4
      },
      "box": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 3142.4,
        "w": 736,
        "h": 61.6
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "My approach to UX design is rooted in empathy. I’m a deep thinker, the kind of person friends come to when they want to talk through life’s problems — and I bring that same listening and problem-solving mindset to my craft.",
      "tag": "h5",
      "section": "Project Overview",
      "local": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 366
      },
      "box": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 3244,
        "w": 736,
        "h": 92.4
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside of work, you’ll find me mastering my favourite video games, fixing my car (again), or talking design over a beer or coffee.",
      "tag": "h5",
      "section": "Project Overview",
      "local": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 498.4
      },
      "box": {
        "x": 16,
